            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Yan, Zheng and Cohn, Jenae and Piech, Chris. (June). Zheng Yan's Science Communication ePorfolio. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: https://purl.stanford.edu/nb840zt5577",
